                    'lean "mean-value" obtain ⟨c, h1, h2, h3⟩ := key _ _ _ ‹_› '
                    '‹∀ y, _ ≤ y ∧ y ≤ _ → _› ‹∀ y, _ < y ∧ y < _ → _›\n'
                    'lean "mean-value" exact ⟨c, by first | exact ⟨h1, h2, h3⟩ '
