                '; disjoint sets added up: by induction on the number n of '
                'elements of Y\n'
                'show hassize($X, $k) ∧ hassize($Y, $n) ∧ $X ∩ $Y = ∅  ⇒  '
                'hassize($X ∪ $Y, $k + $n)    "hassize-union"\n'
